t","time"],"contamination_handled":"no","human_eval":"none","human_eval_details":"","artifact_url":"","reimplementable":"partial","qa":{"QA1":0.5,"QA2":1,"QA3":0,"QA4":0,"QA5":1,"QA6":0.5,"QA7":1,"QA8":0,"QA9":0,"QA10":0},"confidence":"low","notes":"Optimization quality is judged only by GPT-4o-mini pairwise ELO, with no measured runtime; the authors defer actual execution-time measurement to future work. Inputs are human-written industrial snippets that the LLM rewrites, so the paper is borderline adjacent / IC3. Prompts are not provided. Five executions are mentioned but no variance is reported. Programming languages are not stated."}
