{"eligibility":"include","exclusion_criterion":"","side_list":"none","eligibility_reason":"Proposes an LLM inference framework for generating PDE solver code (CoT, self-debugging, nRMSE-feedback refinement, best-of-n) and reports execution time of the generated solvers. This is borderline: runtime is reported only descriptively per model and PDE, not compared across technique conditions.","title":"CodePDE: An Inference Framework for LLM-driven PDE Solver Generation","year":2025,"venue":"Transactions on Machine Learning Research (02/2026)","venue_type":"peer-reviewed-journal","study_type":"technique-proposal","techniques":[{"technique_name":"CodePDE (CoT generation + execution-feedback self-debugging + nRMSE/runtime-feedback refinement + best-of-n)","family_v0":"hybrid","stage":"post-generation-loop","signal_source":["test-execution","self"],"tools":"Python execution on NVIDIA RTX 2080 Ti; nRMSE, convergence test, runtime logged","iterations":"Up to 4 debugging rounds. Best-of-32 sampling. Refinement uses 5 seed programs and 12 samples, best kept.","dims_targeted":["efficiency"],"dims_measured":["efficiency"],"correctness_measured":true,"metrics":"efficiency: average solver execution time (execution); correctness/accuracy: nRMSE vs reference, bug-free rate, convergence order (execution)","benchmarks":"PDEBench and FNO data: Advection, Burgers, Reaction-Diffusion, CNS, Darcy; 100 test instances each, 50 dev instances","languages":"Python","models":"16 LLMs incl. GPT-4o, GPT-4o mini, GPT-4.1, o1-mini, o3, o3-mini, o4-mini (closed); Claude-3.5-haiku, Claude-3.7-sonnet (closed); Gemini 2.0 Flash, 2.0 Flash Thinking, 2.5 Pro (closed); Qwen-2.5-Max, QwQ-Plus; DeepSeek-V3, DeepSeek-R1 (open)","baselines":"Ablations without refine/scale/debug; reference numerical solvers; Dedalus; py-pde; neural solvers (FNO, U-Net, PINN, ORCA, PDEformer, UPS); FunSearch; AIDE","effect_target":"NR","effect_target_headline":"","effect_correctness":"+","effect_correctness_headline":"Claude-3.7-sonnet geom. mean nRMSE 4.44 × 10−3 (CodePDE) vs 1.49 × 10−1 (w/o refine+scale+debug); bug-free rate 41% to 84%","effect_other_dims":{"readability-maintainability":"NR","efficiency":"targeted","security":"NR"}}],"compute_reported":["tokens","cost"],"contamination_handled":"no","human_eval":"none","human_eval_details":"","artifact_url":"https://github.com/LithiumDA/CodePDE","reimplementable":"yes","qa":{"QA1":1,"QA2":1,"QA3":0.5,"QA4":1,"QA5":1,"QA6":0,"QA7":1,"QA8":1,"QA9":0,"QA10":0.5},"confidence":"low","notes":"Borderline IC3. Efficiency (runtime) is reported only per model and PDE in Figs 11 and 13, with no before/after comparison across techniques. The exception is Table 10 (human hint): runtime 191.61s without hint vs 1221.57s with hint, i.e. slower. The refinement prompt explicitly asks for faster code. Figures are garbled in the extracted text."}
